ode1.irmos:
That which had been hewn down divided the undivided, and land unseen was seen by the sun;
water engulfed the cruel enemy, and Israel traversed the impassable, chanting a hymn://
Let us sing unto the Lord, for gloriously hath He been glorified!

ode4.irmos:
O Lord, I have heard the mystery of Thy dispensation;
I have considered Thy works,//
and I have glorified Thy Divinity.
